# Broken nested clone of smithersai/smithers. Its .git has no HEAD file, so
# every `git -C smithers ...` silently resolves to THIS repo instead, and its
# src/ tree is empty (0 files). It is never reached at runtime: the smithers
# CLI is resolved from node_modules/smithers-orchestrator first (see
# src/cli/index.ts findSmithersCliPath). Kept on disk only so the ~/smithers
# and ~/sovereign/projects/smithers symlinks do not dangle. Handle via the
# broken-.git cleanup, not via a commit.
/smithers/
